    {
      "game": "Whisper Mountain Outbreak",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/20019/450x258/whisper-mountain-outbreak-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1792598400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/20019-buy-whisper-mountain-outbreak-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Vessel0X",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/26773902-1740329263.jpg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "First of all, the concept of the idea of this game is good, like a classical resident evil where you have to solve some puzzles to get the item you need to and leave, thats ok. But the problem is, that this game is literally made for and only Coop pve, wich means if you wanna play alone, here's whats gonna happens, the game doesnt tell you the time when you have to finnish, but the more you stay, more zombies will arrive, whats that means? Its gonna be you and only you to defend yourself and leave, The worst part? When you want to extract, You have to wait 10 seconds, 10 GODDAMN SECONDS TO WAIT AND LEAVE, and while that happens, zombies will yes or yes show up."
    },
    {
      "game": "Anno 117: Pax Romana",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/17036/450x258/anno-117-pax-romana-pc-ubisoft-connect-cover.jpg?v=1792598400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/17036-buy-anno-117-pax-romana-pc-ubisoft-connect/",
      "user": "Great",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/1966450-1561901857.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "A worthy successor to Anno 1800. Enough new elements, and improved graphics, to make this series feel fresh. And then it's the setting, ancient Rome. Count on Ubisoft to create highly detailed realistic buildings and settings. 10/10"
    },
    {
      "game": "Star Wars: Galactic Racer Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22526/450x258/star-wars-galactic-racer-deluxe-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1792598400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22526-buy-star-wars-galactic-racer-deluxe-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Midnight",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Excellent game, some tricks and features make it a bit more than just a pod race, modification and personalization of pods & motojets is OK+, online could require stricter ping/internet speed connection so you don't see the opponents litteraly teleporting ...\n\n\n\nStill highly recommanded !"
    },
    {
      "game": "Bendy and the Ink Machine",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/5711/450x258/bendy-and-the-ink-machine-pc-mac-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1792598400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/5711-buy-bendy-and-the-ink-machine-pc-mac-game-steam/",
      "user": "DeagleBPM",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/30397067-1788983957.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "This game is just so freaking peak, I love it so much. It's just a must-play game. I 100% completed the game with all the achievements unlocked, so all I have to say is that you should beat the game too. It's really fun and worth playing, especially if you like Bendy or story games like this. The story is pretty nice if you play it for the first time, but it does get boring if you've already beaten the game once and did all the achievements. Then you can't really do anything else rather than beating the game again! I recommend it, pretty nice game, and basically my childhood!"
